16)--------------------------Projection: date_dim.d_date_sk
17)----------------------------Filter: date_dim.d_date >= Date32("1999-02-01") AND date_dim.d_date <= Date32("1999-04-02")
18)------------------------------TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk, d_date], partial_filters=[date_dim.d_date >= Date32("1999-02-01"), date_dim.d_date <= Date32("1999-04-02")]
