22)------------------Projection: web_site.web_site_sk
23)--------------------Filter: web_site.web_company_name = Utf8View("pri")
24)----------------------TableScan: web_site projection=[web_site_sk, web_company_name], partial_filters=[web_site.web_company_name = Utf8View("pri")]
25)--------------SubqueryAlias: __correlated_sq_1
26)----------------SubqueryAlias: ws2
27)------------------TableScan: web_sales projection=[ws_warehouse_sk, ws_order_number]
28)----------SubqueryAlias: __correlated_sq_2
29)------------SubqueryAlias: wr1
30)--------------TableScan: web_returns projection=[wr_order_number]
